<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/doi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Digital Object Identifier (DOI)](https://www.doi.org/the-identifier/what-is-a-doi/) is a unique, [ISO 26324](https://www.iso.org/standard/88862.html)-standardized identifier for physical, digital, or abstract objects, formatted as a prefix and suffix separated by a forward slash (e.g., `10.1000/182`)."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/dimensions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/Dimensions> .
